From f8efced2cef40a7d5be2134d8e5ab9b26819f3bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ry <ry@local>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 21:58:57 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] nebulos bridge: RECONSTRUCTED ops 0-6 + JNI + frame hooks
 (original source lost)

RECONSTRUCTED from RaBridge.kt, the surviving op 7/8/9 patches and a disassembly of the
previously built libretroarch-activity.so; not the original source.

nebulos_bridge.c: RaBridge JNI (nativeButton/nativeAxis/nativeReleaseAll/nativeRequest), one-slot
request mailbox served on the RetroArch thread, ops 1 save, 2 load, 3 pause, 4 resume, 5 quit,
6 flush SRAM/RTC (unknown ops, e.g. the 99 liveness probe, are no-ops answering 0).
Hooks: nebulos_bridge_poll (android_input_poll), run_begin/run_end (around retro_run in core_run),
nebulos_bridge_overlay (input_driver_state_wrapper, port 0 pad + analog merge).
Android.mk links nebulos_bridge.c into libretroarch-activity.so.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
